      <article class="project">
        <div class="text">
          <div class="ph"><h3>Defect data collection system</h3><span class="when">2022</span></div>
          <p class="outcome">Recurring defects on incoming parts down 13%; still in daily use.</p>
          <p class="body">Built the Excel-based system that logs and analyses incoming-part defects so recurring problems trace back to a supplier or a step and get fixed at the source, with automated dashboards for quality trends. It fed supplier audits and Poka-Yoke fixes.</p>
          
          <p class="tools"><span>Tools</span>Excel · supplier quality · root cause analysis</p>
