      </article>
      
      <article class="project has-media">
        <div class="text">
          <div class="ph"><h3>Bottle-line breakage reduction</h3><span class="when">2020 – 2021</span></div>
          <p class="outcome">Throughput up 9%; ₹30,000 saved per shift.</p>
          <p class="body">Returned “market bottles” were breaking in the infeed worm, wearing the machine and losing blend. Root-cause analysis pointed to back pressure from bottles arriving too fast; I designed and installed an S-shaped guideway to slow and space them.</p>
          <ul class="points"><li>Breakage in the worm and the associated machine wear largely eliminated</li><li>Delivered while owning preventive and corrective maintenance for the line</li></ul>
          <p class="tools"><span>Tools</span>Root cause analysis · conveyor design · preventive maintenance</p>
        </div>
