          <p class="body">Designed a device that dispenses the right medication at the right time with a reminder. A customer survey set the priorities; nine critical-to-quality targets (tamper- and error-proof, under 9″×6″×3″ and 20 oz, $75 target, six pill types) were checked against competitors in a House of Quality and drove concept selection.</p>
          
