      <article class="project">
        <div class="text">
          <div class="ph"><h3>DMAIC-R: adding a Revisit stage</h3><span class="when">2025, in progress</span></div>
          <p class="outcome">A research paper from three years of applying DMAIC on the floor.</p>
          <p class="body">Control phases tend to be static, and improvements erode as products, systems and people change. The proposed Revisit stage adds structured, periodic reassessment (analyse revisited, improvements reassessed, control re-established) using the same charts and root-cause tools. The inventory-accuracy work above is the paper&#x27;s case study.</p>
          
          <p class="tools"><span>Tools</span>Lean Six Sigma · research writing</p>
